      "chunk_id": "916d464a58b3_0",
      "doc_id": "916d464a58b3",
      "text": "I am not happy with this phone. I am not happy with this phone. First of all, it isn't worth the money. I had the S5 and there was so much hype about this phone that I had to get it. There is no reason for the hype. The camera quality is nothing special, despite the promotion. The rounded edge is very annoying when using apps. It's hard to get to the edges of games and other apps without setting off the search feature for the phone. Further, the phone is glass, front and back, and easily breaks. The worst is the fingerprint application, which is on the back of the phone,by the camera lens. Whose idiot choice was that? I want my fingerprint app on the front of the phone, not on the camera lens where I'll leave skin oil! The size of the phone is awkward because it's so narrow. Why not make it wider?",
